senses
  entry
    definition "the vertical dimension of extension; distance from the base of something to the top"
    id oewn-05144430-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (tallness)
  entry
    definition "the highest level or degree attainable; the highest stage of development"
    examples ("his landscapes were deemed the acme of beauty" "the artist's gifts are at their acme" "at the height of her career" "the peak of perfection" "summer was at its peak" "… catapulted Einstein to the pinnacle of fame" "the summit of his ambition" "so many highest superlatives achieved by man" "at the top of his profession")
    id oewn-13963489-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (acme elevation peak pinnacle summit superlative meridian tiptop top)
  entry
    definition "(of a standing person) the distance from head to foot"
    id oewn-05009517-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (stature)
  entry
    definition "elevation especially above sea level or above the earth's surface"
    examples ("the altitude gave her a headache")
    id oewn-05138912-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (altitude)
